# Memory entry

Copy one block per lesson into the repository's memory file. Keep the ISO date
in the heading; the freshness checker reads it.

## YYYY-MM-DD Short statement of the lesson

- Status: active
- Scope: where this applies (package, command, environment) and where it does not
- Lesson: one or two sentences a newcomer can act on
- Evidence: [owning file or test](../path/to/evidence) and the command that showed it
- Why it was surprising: the expectation it contradicted
- Promote to: nothing yet / policy / check / decision record (and why)
- Last verified: YYYY-MM-DD

